    "name":  "Dichroic LED RGB + 3000K - 8W 110º GU10 with Remote Control",
    "reference":  "GU10-RGB-92034",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDichroic LED 8W RGB + 3000K GU10\u003c/strong\u003e. This versatile bulb combines RGB colors with \u003cstrong\u003ewarm white light\u003c/strong\u003e to offer customized lighting to your taste. Includes a \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e for easy and convenient control, allowing you to adjust the atmosphere of any room according to your needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for decorating and creating indoor atmospheres, this 8W bulb allows you to create the ideal atmosphere with style and efficiency. Add a touch of color and warmth to your home today!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRGB + 3000K LED Dichroic Bulb - 8W 110º GU10 with Remote Control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e8W RGB + 3000K GU10 Dichroic LED Bulb\u003c/strong\u003e combines 16 million RGB colors with warm 3000K white.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features:\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1. Customizable Lighting\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2. Remote Control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3. Energy Efficient:\u003c/strong\u003e 8W LED\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4. Versatility:\u003c/strong\u003e Standard GU10 fitting\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5. Advanced Lighting Modes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eApplications: Modern homes, creative offices, commercial spaces, special events.\u003c/h3\u003e",
